Jab karbala ki simt<br />
<br />
Haaye...<br />
Jab karbala ki simt badha haq ka rahnuma..<br />
kuch aagaya khayal jo maa ke mazaar ka<br />
aaya sue baqi wo... zahra ka laadla<br />
rukhsaar rakhke sadre lahad, par ye di sadaa<br />
chhut-ta hai ab madina mere, dil ko thaam lo<br />
amma ghareeb bete ka aakhir salaam lo<br />
<br />
amma tumhare laal se, chut-ta hai aaj ghar<br />
amma tumhare laal se, bargashta har nazar<br />
amma tumhare laal ka dushman hai har bashar<br />
amma tumhare laal ka hai aakhri safar<br />
sehra mein dil ke tukdo'n ki basti basaega<br />
amma hussain ab na madine mein aayega<br />
<br />
maa se ye keh raha tha abhi maa ka laadla<br />
awaaz aayi qabr se, aye mere mehlaqa<br />
sadqe teri musibat o ghurbat ke fatema<br />
bus aye hussain bus ke hila, arshe kibriya<br />
tadpe ab hasan bhi dile beqaraar se<br />
beta rasool e haq nikal aaye mazaar se<br />
<br />
aye mere laal tere iraado'n ke mai nisaar<br />
ye aakhri safar hai mere dil ka izteraar<br />
kaise kahu'n jo dil pe guzarti hai gul azaar<br />
hota hai be charaagh mere baap ka mazaar<br />
jo tujh pe zulm honge ye dukhiya uthayegi<br />
beta ye ghum-naseeb tere saath jayegi<br />
<br />
aansu bahaungi tere ranjo alam ke saath<br />
aankhein bichaungi tere nakshe qadam ke saath<br />
zehra nedhaal hogi har ek taaza ghum ke saath<br />
mera kaleja niklega akbar ke dum ke saath<br />
ghabra na mere laal har ek dukh bataungi<br />
mai tere saath laasha e akbar uthaungi<br />
<br />
jaaega tu jo neher pe bhai ki laash par<br />
mai tere saath saath chalungi barehna sar<br />
beta hussain kya tujhe is ki nahi khabar<br />
abbas tera bhai to mera dilo jigar<br />
tu laashe layega to safe ghum bichaungi<br />
mai god mein kate hue haatho'n ko laungi<br />
<br />
beta hasan ke laal ki khatir ye kya malaal<br />
mere hasan ne tujhpe nichawar kiya wo laal<br />
fidye ke waaste koi karta hai yu malaal<br />
beta mai us ghadi bhi rahungi shareek e haal<br />
ghum hai qadam uthake dile paash paash ke<br />
tukde chunungi rann mein mai qasim ki laash ke<br />
<br />
haan mere laadle meri zainab se hoshiyaar<br />
be parda ho na jaye kahi'n meri pardadaar<br />
mehmil ke saath saath ho abbas e zee'n weqaar<br />
takeed ho ye akbar e mehroo ko baar baar<br />
aamada har qadam pe rahe peshwayi ko<br />
takleef ho na raah mein zehra ki jaayi ko<br />
<br />
jaa marqad e rasool pe aye mere laal afaam<br />
lazim hai nana jaan ko bhi aakhri salaam<br />
dena meri taraf se ye hasrat bhara payaam<br />
mumkin nahi madine mein zehra kare qayaam<br />
tum bhi lahu mein apna chaman dekhne chalo<br />
zainab ke bazuo'n mein rasan dekhne chalo..(2)
